WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.320
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.250
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.410
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.410
Let's Aikatsu!

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.500
Yes, this aura!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.150
Miss Kanzaki is down there!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:45.920
Hello, and nice to meet you!

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.660
What an aura...

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.010
No way, she's—!

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.580
Hi, Mizuki!

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.460
I wanted to see you so bad! {hmm...}

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.870
Welcome to Starlight Academy,

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.740
Ichinose Kaede.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.610
Yes! Kaede Sushi!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.490
Aoi, you feeling alright?

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:53.670
Kaede Sushi.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:58.360
It's a super high-class sushi restaurant chain in America. {It should be super-high-class, but that's a little...}

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.130
Yes! Kaede Sushi!

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:05.500
...is her catchphrase. She's been in commercials her entire life

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.200
and is super popular in America.

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:12.380
She's even a member of the idol-based TV show <i>Kids Club</i>.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:16.640
Ichinose Kaede-chan is the American super idol.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.390
Super idol?

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:20.180
But why would she be here...

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.880
And with this timing...

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.370
We welcome you, Kaede.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.240
But even if you <i>did</i> finish up all of your work, {split}

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.270
you were supposed to wait until the 
 beginning of summer break to come.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:34.520
I just couldn't wait after I heard that Mizuki was forming a unit.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.650
But that means...

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:39.590
Is there anyone other than me

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.810
who has the qualifications to form a unit with Mizuki?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.910
I knew she'd want to join the audition.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.410
Bad! The audition has already started.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:54.670
Wall climbing, Aikatsu walking, even bull riding and wind fighting.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.300
And a live concert to finish it off!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.050
The honeys here before you have overcome these intense trials

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.300
to make it to this final stage.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.760
You were just a tad late, American honey.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.930
I know. That's why I did my own audition back in America.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:15.270
Please watch this and decide if I can take the final audition.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.930
The Grand Canyon?!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.320
Wow, it's so high!

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.120
First stage: The wall to top idol.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:34.710
Second stage: Open air runway!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.920
The Golden Gate Bridge?!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.300
Like in the movies!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.930
Third stage: A rodeo live!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.100
That pony is so cute!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.390
That's not what you should be watching...

00:04:57.430 --> 00:05:00.120
Fourth stage: Battling the wind!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.120
A rocket!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:05.150
It's a completely different scale from our audition... it's a much higher level!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.130
And for the final stage, I used Yankee Stadium as—

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.770
That's enough.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:14.540
But why? Everyone back home really loved my concert.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.500
You can show us at tomorrow's concert.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:19.790
Then that means!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.300
I approve her participation in the final audition.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.730
Any issues, Headmistress?

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.480
This is your choice, Mizuki.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.400
I understand.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:35.690
The final audition will be a single live performance.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:36.690
Understand?

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:40.940
Yes! I'll make sure you have the time of your life, Mizuki.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.640
Kaede-chan is so amazing.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:49.650
No wonder they call her the American super idol.

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.980
We won't be able to take this lightly.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.250
It's the appearance of a powerful new foe.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.370
We need to find some way to improve our skills somehow before the final audition.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:11.390
Her aura's so bright.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.310
Thank you.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.700
Huh?

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.120
Amazing!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:24.740
Did you like it?

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.920
Yeah, a lot.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.300
Great!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.680
Hey, um...

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.050
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:36.150
Ichigo means strawberry. That's a cute name. {Now I'll never have to TN this again}

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.140
Thanks.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.510
Ichigo...

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:42.360
Do people in Japan not really like tap dancing or something?

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:49.940
I remember you were the only one who enjoyed me parachuting in too...

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.530
No, that's not it.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.560
I'm sure everyone was just surprised.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:55.790
Really? That's good then.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.220
Thanks, Ichigo!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:09.150
At tomorrow's audition, I'll make everyone have fun for sure.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.300
At the audition?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.950
Yeah, so get excited!

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.700
Got it.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.850
What are you doing?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:23.200
I'm watching that star.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.170
A star?

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:25.990
It's the first star, I see.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:26.960
Yes.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.410
Mizuki.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:33.810
Ever since you became the top idol, you've been shining all by yourself just like that star.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.520
Tristar.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.450
Not one, but three stars.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:42.480
Those who will be able to shine as brilliantly as your star...

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.860
I wonder who they will be.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.310
I want to find out soon.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.000
Bright red! Love you!

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.930
Yurika-sama, what is the meaning of all these tomatoes?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.790
It's in preparation for my next audition.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.960
What was the next audition again?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.320
It hasn't been announced yet, but I'm storing vampiric power

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.630
so that I'll be ready at any time.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:17.560
Otome too! I'm having Pop'n Popcorn as dessert to pump my spirit up!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.810
I should not expect any less from my senpai.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:23.670
I am still so immersed in sorrow from failing the audition {split}

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:27.480
that I am unable to bring out the Kitaouji Theater.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.330
If I got depressed from one or two failures,

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:33.230
there's no way I'd have been able to live as a 600-year-old vampire.

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.570
Next time we'll try even even harder!

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:39.460
I understand now! I shall renew my feelings

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:43.750
and persist onward.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.580
So how are you going to deal with the black ship?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.070
Black ship?

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.200
The black ships:

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:53.220
The large warships that Commodore Perry captained from America

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.890
into the Uraga sea during the Edo period.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.890
Hi! I'm from America!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.520
With the appearance of the black ships, the age of the samurai ended,

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:06.100
and Japan underwent great modernizations in both technology and institutions.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:09.250
So you are implying that with 
Ichinose Kaede's appearance here,

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.480
Starlight Academy may undergo a large change?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.820
Am I correct?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.530
That may not not be the case here.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.030
What're you getting so weak-kneed for?!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:25.870
Ichinose Kaede has the ability to back up her reputation as a super idol.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:26.970
Yeah.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.700
Her entrance was stunning.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.020
Even her audition in America was unbelievable.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:34.050
Not to mention that amazing aura as she danced.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.170
It's like her ability is on a different level—
no, a different magnitude...

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:38.750
Yeah.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.430
Geez! Hey, you.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.480
The one with her head in the clouds.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.140
Say something about how pathetic these two are acting!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:51.730
I think they're right. Kaede-chan and I are different.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.280
What do you mean?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:56.570
Hey, why are we taking this audition again?

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.780
What do you think you're saying?

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.980
I know...

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.410
Tomorrow's audition is to try and get into Tristar.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.850
But is that really enough?

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.310
What else could there be besides that?

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.130
I just can't figure it out...

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.840
I need to know!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:13.920
Ichigo!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.280
Where are you going?

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.200
Yes?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.720
Ichigo! And...

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.650
My friends Aoi and Ran.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.280
All three of us are taking the final audition tomorrow.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.570
Oh!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.940
Nice to meet you, Aoi, Ran.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:44.090
Right...

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:45.370
Same here...

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.670
Kaede-chan, there's something I just absolutely have to ask you.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.220
Then come on in.

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.290
Thanks!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.220
Tempura?

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.050
I grew up in America,

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.550
so I've always watched Japan from afar.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.590
That's why I'm so happy now that I've finally made it!

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.310
Watch closely.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:14.820
Here you go.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.330
Thank you.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.660
Yay, it's sushi!

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.170
Those magic tricks were amazing, Kaede-chan!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.660
But why magic?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.210
It all started when I met a certain clown...

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:34.960
I've loved Magical Toy's brand of dresses since I was a little girl.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.460
I eventually started trying to get myself Premium Rare cards.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:49.100
Please allow me to have Magical Toy's Premium Rare cards.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.600
You're Magical Toy's top designer, aren't you?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.070
I know everything there is to know about you!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.700
You walk around the city dressed like a clown so that you can make people laugh,

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.910
all while looking for inspiration for your designs.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:07.870
Right?

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:14.130
I'm the same. I love making other people happy.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.490
That's the reason I became an idol.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.880
I—!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:25.060
I love Magical Toy! I've finally found you after such a long time!

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.390
I'm so happy.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:33.750
Yes!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.530
I'll definitely become the top idol.

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.700
I promise!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.020
So please give me those cards!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:52.600
Wow! Thank you! Thank you very much!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:03.300
Clown Carnival Coord... those are 
Magical Toy Premium Rare cards. {the way you had it made it sound like they were the only Magical Toy Premium cards}

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:07.080
I'll use these cards to bring a smile to everyone's face tomorrow!

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.710
There, that's it!

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.760
That's what I wanted to ask about!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.880
Parachuting, tap dancing, and magic.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:17.410
All of that was to make other people have fun, wasn't it?

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:18.990
That's right.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:21.030
What about the final audition tomorrow?

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.820
I'll be doing my best to let everyone have fun.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:27.200
But isn't the audition just to 
determine who'll be chosen?

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.540
Right, but even an audition is a performance.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.890
As long as I'm standing on stage,

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.810
my priority is to entertain my fans.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.540
That's what being an idol means to me.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.570
Yeah... that's exactly right!

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.620
True. We were so focused on trying to get into Tristar

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.470
that we forgot the most important thing.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.490
The scales from my eyes... {thanks for the lesson, Masato}

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.630
That's what it means to be a super idol.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:52.970
She sure is on a different level...

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.560
I'm sorry!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:55.980
Ah, it's Mizuki-san.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.480
This is quite the collection!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.240
You're her fan?

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:01.020
Yeah.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:04.860
I learned about Mizuki while I was researching Japan...

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.200
I felt like I just had to perform together with her.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.570
What's wrong, Ichigo?

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:10.780
We're the same.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:15.370
All of us are in this because we want to stand alongside Mizuki-san on stage.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.070
Yeah, that's part's definitely the same.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.440
Yes!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:25.010
Girls, let's do our best tomorrow!

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:27.840
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.340
Let's raise the curtain on the final audition!

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.010
The top idol Kanzaki Mizuki's first unit;

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:39.350
Tristar's members will be chosen today.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:43.960
Unexpectedly, Ichinose Kaede has decided to join the final fray.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:47.610
What kind of performance will America's super idol show us today?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.300
What?! Ichinose Kaede's entering too?!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.490
I wonder how the audition'll turn out!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:57.120
The remaining idols will present us with their best singing and dancing.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.870
This is truly the stage where their worth as idols will be tested.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.880
Just who will be chosen?

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:08.520
I wonder what sort of influence Ichinose-honey will have on the audition. {holy crap, new honorific?} {about time}

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.970
It's getting exciting.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.920
Ichigo-tan, Aoi-tan, Ran-tan, fight!

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:16.180
Those three will be just fine.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:19.390
If not, then I'll have no choice but to suck their blood.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.100
Everyone, I shall be cheering for you

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.480
from the ends of my hair to the tip of my toes. {mmm....}

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.030
Let's start the audition!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:28.650
The leadoff hitters are...

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:34.690
The third-years Ichihara Ichika, 
Nishijima Nino, and Miura Sango!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.790
It's finally time.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.730
Right.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.370
No matter how many times I've done it, I can't help but get nervous before a concert.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:51.300
Let's put on the very best performance we can!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.680
Yeah! We'll put a smile on everyone's faces.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.250
Yeah.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.510
Yes!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:46.200
And with that, the final audition has ended!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.570
All of them put on wonderful performances.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.000
As expected of my students.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.420
Good job, me!

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:56.010
Kanzaki Mizuki-san, a few words, if you would.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.420
Great job out there, everyone.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.930
Each one of you put on a wondrous and gleeful performance.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:09.180
Now it is time to reveal who among you have proven themselves worthy of joining the new unit!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:12.170
Please unveil your decision!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.900
Kanzaki Mizuki's first unit.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:18.230
The first person I choose to become a member of Tristar is...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.700
Ichinose Kaede-san!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.800
Yes!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.960
The reason I chose Ichinose-san

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:36.730
was that, after she proclaimed herself qualified to join Tristar,

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:41.380
she backed her claim up with her performance today.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:45.770
She holds the power and will needed to convey

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.890
just how much she wants to make her audience enjoy themselves.

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:51.490
Thank you, Mizuki!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.060
The first is Ichinose Kaede.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.300
It's the birth of a new star.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.400
I wonder who the other one will be?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:05.410
Now then Kanzaki-san, please announce the final new member!

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.550
Please forgive me.

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:16.380
I was not able to choose a second member just from today's final audition.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:21.590
Therefore, Hoshimiya Ichigo-san, 
Kiriya Aoi-san, and Shibuki Ran-san—

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:26.430
You three will participate in the "For Real Final Audition".

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.790
"For Real Final Audition"?

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.400
That's quite the name...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.590
There will be yet another battle.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:34.460
But then that means...

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:35.880
Looks like this is it.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:38.970
Oh well. At least we've got no regrets.

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:40.820
Mizuki, thank you.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:44.950
It's all thanks to you that we were able to come this far.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.200
Sango...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.610
Though we couldn't join Tristar,

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:52.700
we'll Aikatsu so hard that we'll never let you down again! {...}

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.290
Yeah, and thank you so much for taking this audition.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:00.360
It'll be hard for such good friends as yourselves to compete like this,

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:01.590
but try hard all the same.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:08.170
In order to determine Tristar's final member,

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:10.840
those three will have to fight once again.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:12.970
It will be an intense trial.

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:15.560
Who should I be cheering for?

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:18.350
<i>The final member of Tristar...</i>

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:57.700
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:00.740
Thanks for picking me, Mizuki.

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.630
The nature to entertain others at all times.

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:04.800
You're amazing.

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:07.380
I love seeing other people smile!

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:09.860
Even auditions are performances!

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:12.310
The last member of Tristar...

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:14.510
I can't believe we're directly competing.

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:16.940
I don't want to lose my friends... But still—!

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.100
Let's all do our best!

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:20.430
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.670
Star of Tears.

00:24:21.670 --> 00:24:25.970
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
